      "description": "An attacker exploited an as-yet-unidentified authorization vulnerability affecting Cyber's cross-chain token bridge, unexpectedly minting 5.213 million CYBER on Solana and triggering the release of an equivalent amount from the Ethereum lockbox through LayerZero messaging. The attacker sold most of the released CYBER through decentralized exchanges for approximately $968K in ETH. The exact mechanism that permitted unauthorized minting and cross-chain redemption remains under investigation"
